      "comments": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "author": "reaganiwadha",
          "created": 1788449600,
          "body": "Rewrote text_input: selection model + shift-motions, Ctrl+A, cut/copy/paste, Ctrl+Backspace word delete, Up/Down in multiline, and a 1px caret quad that no longer shifts the text. Click focuses the field. Still missing: click-to-place-caret mid-text (needs glyph geometry) — tracked as follow-up.",
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "author": "reaganiwadha",
          "created": 1788450076,
          "body": "Still feels awkward. Especially when selecting/highlighting a character from a word you can see each letters jumping. Perhaps we need to see a solution from how zed implements textboxes.",
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "author": "reaganiwadha",
          "created": 1788450439,
          "body": "Can't even jump the caret to other section freely with mouse cursor click",
          "anchor": null
        }
      ]
